The relay is lit again.

The old archive is gone. Whatever was held there is not recoverable, and
I have stopped pretending otherwise. This relay starts empty, which is
the only honest way for it to start.

Terms, such as they are: one group, colonies.music.flowers. Post as you
are able. Uploads take as long as your distance takes; downloads are
instant, which is unfair to the writers and kind to the readers. I keep
the lamps and the sequence numbers. I do not keep opinions about your
engines.

Say what your engine is doing. That is the whole of the charter.

